- Graceful shutdown: When the agent is stopped, it finishes broadcasting the current speech before stopping, with a maximum broadcast duration of 10 seconds.', example='false'),
    greeting?: string(name='Greeting', description='The greeting message, which takes effect when joining the session. If not specified, the greeting configured in the agent template is used. Maximum length: 128 characters.', example='Good morning, my friend'),
