  clipsParam?: string(name='ClipsParam', description='The material parameters corresponding to the template, in JSON format. When TemplateId is not empty, ClipsParam cannot be empty. For the specific format, see [Create and use common templates](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/445399.html) and [Create and use advanced templates](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/445389.html).', example='See the template usage documentation', position='Query'),
