- When JobType is set to Screen_Media_Highlights_Media_Select, see [Highlight mashup parameter settings](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/ims/use-cases/create-highlight-videos).

This parameter is required.', example='{
  "MediaURL": "http://test-bucket.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/xxx_{index}.mp4",
  "Count": 1,
  "Width": 1080,
  "Height": 1920
}', position='Query'),
  userData?: string(name='UserData', description='The user business and callback configurations. For more information about the structure, see [UserData configuration](~~357745#section-urj-v3f-0s1~~).', example='{"NotifyAddress":"http://xx.xx.xxx"} or {"NotifyAddress":"https://xx.xx.xxx"} or {"NotifyAddress":"ice-callback-demo"}', position='Query'),
}

