                isCheckAudioBitrate?: string(name='IsCheckAudioBitrate', description='Specifies whether to check the audio bitrate. You can specify only one of IsCheckAudioBitrate and IsCheckAudioBitrateFail. IsCheckAudioBitrateFail has a higher priority. Valid values:
- true: Checks the bitrate. If the input audio bitrate is lower than the output setting, the input audio bitrate is used for transcoding.
- false: Does not check the bitrate.
