- false if the parameter is empty and the codec is different from the input source.
- true if the parameter is empty and the codec is the same as the input source.', example='true'),
                isCheckAudioBitrateFail?: string(name='IsCheckAudioBitrateFail', description='Specifies whether to check the audio bitrate. You can specify only one of IsCheckAudioBitrate and IsCheckAudioBitrateFail. This parameter has a higher priority. Valid values:
