- false: Does not check the resolution.
Default value: false.', example='true'),
                isCheckResoFail?: string(name='IsCheckResoFail', description='Specifies whether to check the video resolution. You can specify only one of IsCheckReso and IsCheckResoFail. This parameter has a higher priority. Valid values:
