- false: Does not check the bitrate.
Default value: false.', example='true'),
                isCheckVideoBitrateFail?: string(name='IsCheckVideoBitrateFail', description='Specifies whether to check the video bitrate. You can specify only one of IsCheckVideoBitrate and IsCheckVideoBitrateFail. This parameter has a higher priority. Valid values:
