- false: Does not check the bitrate.
Default value: false.', example='true'),
                transMode?: string(name='TransMode', description='The video transcoding mode. Valid values:
- onepass: Typically used for ABR. The encoding speed is faster than twopass.
- twopass: Typically used for VBR. The encoding speed is slower than onepass.
- CBR: Constant bitrate mode.
Default value: onepass.', example='onepass'),
              }(name='TransConfig', description='The conditional transcoding parameters.'),
